\tag{13.19}
$$

The lower matrix is the supplied $A_0$. Every point of the interval is realized by

$$
T(\theta)=(1-\theta)T_{\min}+\theta T_{\max},\qquad
0\le\theta\le1,\qquad
V_u=V_Q=1/45+\theta/90,
\tag{13.20}
